---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="About Us" description="the site is an independent sports analytics platform. Free data-driven predictions, public track record, no cherry-picking.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      {SITE.name} is an independent sports analytics platform. We aggregate football and basketball predictions from 70+ tipster sites, sharp price feeds and prediction models, cross-check them against real settled results, and publish only the picks that pass our audit. Every tip is free.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Our promise</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Every pick is tracked publicly — wins and losses, no cherry-picking.</li>
      <li>We only feature licensed, regulated bookmakers.</li>
      <li>We put responsible gambling first, always.</li>
      <li>Every rule change is a public git commit — nothing is silently retro-fitted.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">How the pipeline works</h2>
    <p>
      In short: every 2 hours we scrape 70+ sources, cross-check them for consensus, and publish picks in three separate tracked systems (WIN, OVERALL, ROI) by odds band. Every match result is settled from up to six independent resolvers with a priority ladder and public conflict log. The full methodology is on our <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/methodology">Methodology page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Why we're independent</h2>
    <p>
      We do not accept bets. We do not sell tips. Nobody pays us for a specific selection. Our revenue comes from affiliate commissions when a visitor clicks through to a bookmaker and signs up — that never costs you anything and never influences a pick. Every review is written independently. Every operator we recommend is licensed by a European regulator.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Where we're based</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} operates from Cyprus. All data processing follows EU GDPR. Our servers are hosted in EU data centres. Legal disputes fall under Cyprus law — see the <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/terms">Terms of Use</a> and <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Track record so far</h2>
    <p>
      Since the GENESIS date (30 August 2026), our clean-slate tracked systems show:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-3">
      <li><strong class="text-sky-400">WIN</strong> — favorites ≤ 1.80: ~59% strike rate.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-brand-400">OVERALL</strong> — value 2.60–3.49: <span class="text-white">+43% ROI</span>.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-gold">ROI</strong> — high value ≥ 3.50: <span class="text-white">+120% ROI</span>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">Live figures are on <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/results">the /results page</a>. Past performance is not a guarantee of future results.</p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Feedback, corrections, partnerships, privacy requests — write to <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or use the <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/contact">Contact page</a>. We answer every email within 48 hours.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 text-xs text-slate-500">
      {SITE.name} — sports analytics for the {SITE.minAge}+ audience only. Please gamble responsibly.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
